    {
      "id": "u_8204681c078aa5af95906f7a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For a background color, add a __TRILIUM_PH_0__ attribute such as __TRILIUM_PH_1__. Without one, a tag with attributes gives a transparent aside block.",
      "sourceHash": "8204681c078aa5af95906f7ada6181a127c689981c5d2b5ac82bf7daa4ea9a30",
      "context": "Supported syntax > Aside blocks",
      "contextHash": "7c7cf92d10b6b4c38ba46e8ef1a85fbfe1430877ca1ac05aeaaf6b216a0f6996",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "背景色を設定するには、 __TRILIUM_PH_0__ のような __TRILIUM_PH_1__属性を追加します。属性を指定しない場合、属性付きのタグは透明なアサイドブロックになります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0119958cd722773f7187903e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The export follows the same rules, and also keeps the width of a resized aside block.",
      "sourceHash": "0119958cd722773f7187903e7274f83e566c198d1dd80150169449ae3952642e",
      "context": "Supported syntax > Aside blocks",
      "contextHash": "7c7cf92d10b6b4c38ba46e8ef1a85fbfe1430877ca1ac05aeaaf6b216a0f6996",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "エクスポートも同様のルールに従い、サイズ変更されたアサイドブロックの幅も保持されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-17T23:34:42.858Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f10dce812f42057c1956a339_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The blank line after the opening tag is required. Without it, the content is read as plain text instead of Markdown, and the aside block takes the full width of the note.",
      "sourceHash": "f10dce812f42057c1956a339cc6c523f6bf70b2eb84767e882fabf199be229f1",
      "context": "Supported syntax > Aside blocks",
      "contextHash": "7c7cf92d10b6b4c38ba46e8ef1a85fbfe1430877ca1ac05aeaaf6b216a0f6996",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "開始タグの後の空行は必須です。これがない場合、コンテンツはMarkdownではなくプレーンテキストとして読み込まれ、アサイドブロックはノートの全幅を取ります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
